client/vendor/useCandidateGroups.ts and the provider sorting, edition selection,
work identity and language helpers are copied from BookOrbit. useMetadataSearch.ts
has its API import redirected to the Shelfarr adapter. Other files implement the
Shelfarr adapter and interface. Corresponding source is downloadable from the
search footer. The running BookOrbit server supplies the unmodified metadata
providers, query fallbacks and relevance filtering. No provider key is added by
this integration. It depends on the local BookOrbit instance and its configured
providers. Shelfarr's existing request policies and acquisition system remain in use.
